{"unit_id":"Rxiain__dsh-openviking#card-card-zh","repo":"Rxiain/dsh-openviking","commit":"ea1880e0f1ec856229e1b7aee11d615964ee34d0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-openviking 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 OpenViking 检索与记忆插件。它通过 DSH 工具、提示词上下文和会话事件接入现有 OpenViking HTTP 服务，提供语义搜索、URI 文件浏览与读取、资源添加和管理、会话提交及经验沉淀。插件还会在模型步骤前召回相关用户与 agent 记忆，注入已索引仓库列表，并按回合节奏同步和自动提交会话。适合希望在 DSH 中搜索共享知识库、积累长期记忆并管理索引资源的用户；需要一个正在运行的 OpenViking 服务，可选配置 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:216","src/tools.ts:243","src/memory-recall.ts:136","src/session-sync.ts:174"]}
{"unit_id":"Rxiain__dsh-openviking#card-card-en","repo":"Rxiain/dsh-openviking","commit":"ea1880e0f1ec856229e1b7aee11d615964ee34d0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-openviking connects OpenViking retrieval and memory to the DSH web client. It integrates through DSH tools, prompt context, and session events, using an existing OpenViking HTTP service. The plugin provides semantic search, viking:// browsing and reading, resource management, session commits, and deliberate lesson capture. It also recalls relevant user and agent memories before model steps, adds indexed repository context to prompts, and syncs and commits sessions on a schedule. It suits users who want searchable shared knowledge, durable memory, and indexed resource management inside DSH. A running OpenViking service is required; an API key is optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:216","src/tools.ts:243","src/memory-recall.ts:136","src/session-sync.ts:174"]}
